From 17a7444048f0f69362f01159801cd1ebc8fd5aa5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joe <joe@n9tax.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:00:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 12/16] net: 32 bit socket ring offsets (sockets 4+ broke), no
 unhook of open sockets, links released once, uIP userrequest cleared; ping:
 unsigned checksum bytes; signals 16-31 exit with their own number; pdp11dec:
 one terminal, 14 processes; netd: SIGUSR1 dumps links

